--- !u!114 &1692254530
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1692254528}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "FIRST TO THREE \xB7 MOUNTAIN TUG\nTeams of one to four face across a lava
    chasm and reverse away from the edge. Up to four humans; AI fills either team.
    Sides swap each round.\n\nHold REVERSE for baseline pull. In each six-second
    cycle, EASE OFF between1.8 and2.35seconds, then reapply REVERSE between2.35 and2.85
    for a stronger heave. The on-screen signal counts the timing. At3\u20133.8seconds
    steer the shown LEFT/RIGHT to brace the heave. A missed cue briefly causes wheelspin.
    Timing Assist accepts a held reverse during the heave window and widens bracing;
    it applies equally to AI. Small steering adjustments reposition your truck; the
    physical tow ropes limit travel.\n\nNWH wheels provide all pulling traction.
    One physical central rope connects the team headers; no hidden team boost or
    rubber band. Mud ruts persist through the round. A team's first chassis crossing
    the clearly marked ledge edge, or actually falling below it, loses the round.
    Same-step losses draw. At80seconds the team that gained at least2.5feet more
    ground wins; a closer result is an explicit draw and replay. Result locks before
    the lava finale. Winners are secured; losing trucks fall physically. Recorded
    flight replays have angle, speed, rewind and skip. Pause/reconnect preserves
    everything. Offline only."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
